hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16525","Waki narrated to us, Sufyan narrated to us, from Zayd ibn Aslam, from Ata ibn Yasar, from a man of Banu Asad, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: Whoever asks while he has an uqiyyah or its equivalent, then he has asked importunately."
